[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23341.51, "timestamp": "06:29:01", "text": "我知道就像那样，我想那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23344.628, "timestamp": "06:29:04", "text": "用我的方式表达感受和情绪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23347.03, "timestamp": "06:29:07", "text": "就像艺术一样，当……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23355.51, "timestamp": "06:29:15", "text": "jokal，这个想法本身就让我感到兴奋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23359.15, "timestamp": "06:29:19", "text": "让我继续前进，不做任何事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23362.468, "timestamp": "06:29:22", "text": "可以说得更好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23366.23, "timestamp": "06:29:26", "text": "所以我的意思是，Jolex 将会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23370.23, "timestamp": "06:29:30", "text": "在测试基地测试基地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23372.19, "timestamp": "06:29:32", "text": "改进。你怎么说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23375.67, "timestamp": "06:29:35", "text": "这？以及建造模式。正确的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23378.43, "timestamp": "06:29:38", "text": "对，对，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23381.67, "timestamp": "06:29:41", "text": "正确的。让我速跑一下。再见。小心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23383.83, "timestamp": "06:29:43", "text": "祝您观看愉快。你好。你好。你也是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23386.788, "timestamp": "06:29:46", "text": "你也是。我们会一直这样做，好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23394.468, "timestamp": "06:29:54", "text": "现在？我觉得我可能需要结束这段关系了。"}]